[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0010","text":"『爱依\n　你家人的话，喜欢什么零食？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0020","text":"『基本上什么都喜欢～』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0030","text":"『那我带冬优现在迷上的曲奇过去』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0040","text":"『哦，不错啊！\n　谢啦冬优子酱！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0050","text":"“好像不错”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0060","text":"『很好吃的哦～？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0070","text":"『好期待～！\n　大家一起吃吧～』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0080","text":"“好的”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0090","text":"～♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0100","text":"（啊，楼下房间打扫干净了吗……？\n　……还是去看一眼吧）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21900100_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
